      "value": "Various species expel their waste within this room. Except ^cyan;Kevin^reset;. Nobody has any clue where he goes to the bathroom, but he has never once used this facility other than as temporary storage for large carnivorous reptiles. ^cyan;Kevin^reset; maintains that this was necessary."
